  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "金融制度專題",
    "sub_ename": "SPECIAL TOPICS IN FINANCIAL SYSTEM",
    "describe_ch": "1980年代各國積極推動金融自由化與國際化，1990年代各國進一步推動金融大改革金融制度變革，2008年金融海嘯衝擊各國進行金融制度改革，2010年以來金融科技創新營運模式，衝擊傳統金融業的業務營運方向。有鑒於此，徹底瞭解各國金融制度及改革方向與金融創新\r\n，乃本課程教學與研討重點。",
    "describe_eh": "Financial reforms in the 90’s was highly introduced after financial liberalization and globalization were promoted vigorously in the 80’s. Due to financial crisis in 2008, financial reforms were further executed accordingly. However, in 2010, financial technology (FinTech) was introduced which has changed the way of business modelling tremendously in this course. We will learn the challenges of the traditional business from financial liberalization to FinTech.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "擁有金融制度發展的思維",
      "describe_en": "Possess the thinking ability of the development of financial system"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "分析與區分金融系統的差異性",
      "describe_en": "Being able to analyze and distinguish financial system"
    }
